WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two observers watch a collision. No glass is visible.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Same event. Different verbs: hit and smashed.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A later question asks about broken glass.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Some responses include what was never there.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
This is evidence about suggestion, not mind control.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Source before story. Read the evidence at Final Vestige.
